AFS ADMIN PUT-SETTING

NAME
       admin put-setting

DESCRIPTION
       Put setting

       collab.base_domain and collab.public_endpoints are read-only until 2.0.0; use orchestration.public_base_domain and orchestration.public_endpoints.

       Required permission: admin:settings

SYNOPSIS
       afs admin put-setting [options]

OPTIONS
       --key (string) (required)
          Known values: secrets.path_prefix, pricing.price_list_sync, billing.variance_alert_pct, api.idempotency_key_ttl_seconds, teams.ephemeral_max_days, work_orders.sla_warning_hours, billing.tag_activation_acknowledged, work_orders.notification_channel_id, reports.idle_cpu_millicores, egress.denied_spike_threshold, gateway.reservation_ttl_seconds, api.cors_origins, orchestration.tools, orchestration.public_base_domain, orchestration.private_base_domain, orchestration.public_endpoints, orchestration.private_endpoints, orchestration.default_limit, orchestration.default_web_ui_exposure, orchestration.default_web_api_exposure, orchestration.default_resources, orchestration.default_volume_gib, models.service_access, models.default_team_access, models.default_team_models, models.default_model_id, collab.allowed_source_cidrs, collab.session_ttl_minutes, collab.content_scan, collab.max_body_mb, collab.denied_spike_threshold, mcp.enabled, mcp.team_server_approval, mcp.host_deny_list, mcp.corporate_domains, mcp.allowed_image_registries, mcp.image_signature_policy, mcp.default_agent_mode, mcp.search_limit_max, mcp.refresh_interval_minutes, mcp.limits, mcp.query_capture_max_days, mcp.events_retention_months, gateway.mcp.placement_default, federation.allowed_audiences
       --value (string or JSON) (required)
          JSON value of the setting's type
       --if-match (string)
          Apply only if the resource is at this version (safe update).

GLOBAL OPTIONS
       --profile                Use a specific profile from ~/.afs/config.
       --endpoint-url           Override the API endpoint URL.
       --output                 Output format: json, yaml, table, text or csv.
       --query                  JMESPath query applied to the result before rendering.
       --no-paginate            Return only the first page of results.
       --max-items              Stop after this many items and print NextToken.
       --page-size              Items per request (maxResults), 1 to 100.
       --starting-token         Resume from a NextToken printed by --max-items.
       --cli-input-json         Read parameters from a JSON document or file://path.
       --generate-cli-skeleton  Print a JSON skeleton of the input and make no call.
       --debug                  Write a redacted request log to stderr.
       --no-cli-pager           Do not send output through a pager.
       --color                  Colored output: on, off or auto.
       --cli-connect-timeout    Connect timeout in seconds (0 for none; default 30).
       --cli-read-timeout       Read timeout in seconds (0 for none; default 60).
       --version                Print the afs version and exit.

EXAMPLES
       Set the base domain of the public orchestration hostnames

       afs admin put-setting --key orchestration.public_base_domain --value '"collab.example.com"'

       Set the base domain of the private (internal ALB) hostnames

       afs admin put-setting --key orchestration.private_base_domain --value '"collab.corp.example.com"'

       Lower the default limit of new teams to private

       afs admin put-setting --key orchestration.default_limit --value '"private"'

       Choose the default model of new agents

       afs admin put-setting --key models.default_model_id --value '"anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-5"'

       Set a list value (JSON)

       afs admin put-setting --key api.cors_origins --value '["https://console.example.com"]'

       Set a number

       afs admin put-setting --key api.idempotency_key_ttl_seconds --value 86400

